==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Cosmic Eclipse|Trevenant|94}} from the {{TCG|Cosmic Eclipse}} expansion.
*'''Claw Slash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|XY Promo|Sableye|92}}, one of the {{TCG|XY Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

